# Gouda's home (YUI-168, yuigui spec/HOME.md): the looper, the chords and the keys, ready to play.
menu shortcut@tune "Tune up" say="Tune my guitar"
menu shortcut@jam "Jam" say="Make me a beat to jam on"
>2
loop@looper 92 "Looper" p=x...x...|..x...x.|........|x.x.x.x. +inline
save looper
>3
chords@chords C I-V-vi-IV "Chords" +inline
save chords
>4
keys@keys C major "Keys" +inline
save keys
